description: "Concept DOI: archivo permanente de todas las versiones de Moleku"

abstract: "Desktop platform for virtual library generation via multi-component reactions (Biginelli, GBB, Gewald), physicochemical descriptor calculation, configurable drug-likeness and structural-alert filtering, InChIKey-based deduplication, integrated local ADMET screening, and research-ready export workflows with reproducible run manifests."

keywords:
  - cheminformatics
  - multi-component reactions
  - virtual library generation
  - computer-aided drug design
  - drug discovery
  - ADMET
  - rdkit
  - Biginelli reaction
  - compound prioritization
